💡 Parameters

| Parameter                | Description                           |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |
| `-d` / `--domain`        | Single domain                         |
| `-f` / `--file`          | Domain list                           |
| `--auto`                 | Run the entire pipeline automatically |
| `--bruteforce`           | Add DNS brute-force                   |
| `--amass-active`         | Amass active mode                     |
| `-w` / `--wordlist`      | Path to DNS wordlist                  |
| `-aw` / `--alt-wordlist` | VHOST/dir/overlay wordlist            |
| `--resolver`             | Resolver for dig fallback             |
| `--pretty`               | Colored, titled output                |

